<title>USA: J.P. Morgan sets $200 mln CPI-linked notes.</title>
<headline>J.P. Morgan sets $200 mln CPI-linked notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of inflation-indexed securities from J.P. Morgan &amp; Co Inc was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>The issue was increased in size by $100 million, said a J.P. Morgan syndicate official.</p>
<p>BORROWER J.P. MORGAN &amp; CO INC</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	   COUPON CPI+4 PCT  MATURITY 2/15/2012</p>
<p>TYPE CPI-LINKED SUB  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 8/15/97 LAST MOODY'S AA3     YIELD CPI+4 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AA				    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672))</p>
</text>
